ing the hearings.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cjps-dipke-accuses-state-of-delaying-proceedings-to-prevent-release-of-saurav-das-ashutosh-ranka/articleshow/135030939.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cjps-dipke-accuses-state-of-delaying-proceedings-to-prevent-release-of-saurav-das-ashutosh-ranka/articleshow/135030939.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-18T20:58:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135030939,imgsize-189594.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Attempts to weaken India's unity cannot be accepted': RSS leader Indresh Kumar on anti-SIR protests]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/attempts-to-weaken-indias-unity-cannot-be-accepted-rss-leader-indresh-kumar-on-anti-sir-protests/articleshow/135030949.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135030949.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/attempts-to-weaken-indias-unity-cannot-be-accepted-rss-leader-indresh-kumar-on-anti-sir-protests/articleshow/135030949.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/attempts-to-weaken-indias-unity-cannot-be-accepted-rss-leader-indresh-kumar-on-anti-sir-protests/articleshow/135030949.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-18T20:53:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135030999,imgsize-95544.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[CISF to reorganise eight territorial sectors into specialised functional units from November 1]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cisf-to-reorganise-eight-territorial-sectors-into-specialised-functional-units-from-november-1/articleshow/135030596.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135030596.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Starting November 1, the Central Industrial Security Force will reorganize into functional sectors to enhance security management. This restructuring aims to address the specialized needs of various industries and government installations. Eleven sectors will be transformed to focus on specific sectors like coal, power, and petroleum. Existing arrangements for the Department of Atomic Energy and airports will remain unchanged. The move is expected to improve operational oversight and sector-specific expertise.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cisf-to-reorganise-eight-territorial-sectors-into-specialised-functional-units-from-november-1/articleshow/135030596.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cisf-to-reorganise-eight-territorial-sectors-into-specialised-functional-units-from-november-1/articleshow/135030596.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-18T20:23:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Bharti Jain</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135030613,imgsize-87930.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Nothing to do with Imran': MNS after Aamir Khan meets Raj Thackeray amid legal troubles for actor's nephew]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nothing-to-do-with-imran-mns-after-aamir-khan-meets-raj-thackeray-amid-legal-troubles-for-actors-nephew/articleshow/135029597.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135029597.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nothing-to-do-with-imran-mns-after-aamir-khan-meets-raj-thackeray-amid-legal-troubles-for-actors-nephew/articleshow/135029597.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nothing-to-do-with-imran-mns-after-aamir-khan-meets-raj-thackeray-amid-legal-troubles-for-actors-nephew/articleshow/135029597.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-18T19:37:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135030327,imgsize-90280.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Evening news wrap: Rijiju alleges violence plot during protests, CM Suvendu orders probe into home guards after stampede &amp; more]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-rijiju-alleges-violence-plot-during-protests-cm-suvendu-orders-probe-into-home-guards-after-stampede-more/articleshow/135029219.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135029219.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Kiren Rijiju alleged that opposition leaders are conspiring to incite violence amidst the Special Intensive Revision protests. West Bengal Chief Minister Suvendu Adhikari has ordered an investigation following a tragic stampede in Kolkata. Rahul Gandhi accused Prime Minister Narendra Modi and others of voter fraud while urging public support for Congress in upcoming elections.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-rijiju-alleges-violence-plot-during-protests-cm-suvendu-orders-probe-into-home-guards-after-stampede-more/articleshow/135029219.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-rijiju-alleges-violence-plot-during-protests-cm-suvendu-orders-probe-into-home-guards-after-stampede-more/articleshow/135029219.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-18T18:47:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmln